      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. What about the cost though? I heard flying can sometimes be way cheaper if you book in advance. Is the price difference between the Shinkansen and a domestic flight (like ANA or JAL) significant enough to justify the extra travel time to the airports?",
