    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. i'll probably stick to the trains then. one more thing—can you help me figure out the logistics for my luggage? i have to carry a heavy equipment case with me. if i'm using the Shinkansen, is it hard to find space for big bags, or do i need to book a specific seat with extra room?",
