    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For heavy equipment cases, you generally do not need to book a special seat, but you should bring the bag on board at the station (not in the guest luggage manifest) to avoid delays and ensure it stays with you. Shinkansen reservations are confirmed instantly via the GIABA website or app, but knowing your carriage number ensures you don't need to switch trains if there's an operational issue. When traveling with large items, it is also advisable to have an e-ticket printed or downloaded in case the reservation system encounters glitches during boarding.",
